{"0":{"event_id":"509679","game_id":"0","isoa":"0","locations":[["1002","1000"]],"started":"1","ended":"0","reward_cash":"1800","reward_exp":"4000","need_briefing":"1","title":"The Clue","briefing":"We received a radio signal yesterday from a group of survivors who were looking for a safe haven. I gave them our location, and instructed them to follow a back-alley route through central Fairview. We expected them to arrive at the holdout yesterday afternoon, but they still haven\u2019t shown up and they are not responding to our radio alerts.<br><br>I have a bad feeling about this one. I need you travel to their last known location, the source of yesterday\u2019s radio signal, and search for any clues as to what might of happened to them. I\u2019ve marked the location on your map.","special_enemy_type":"0","special_enemy_amount":"0","boss_num":"0","event_type":"mission","dfp_objectives":{"loot":"Find clue to their location","loot_amount":"1","area_highlight":"1002_1000"},"start_time":"1786521601","end_time":"1786563601"},"1":{"event_id":"509681","game_id":"1","isoa":"0","locations":[["1029","1006"]],"started":"1","ended":"0","reward_cash":"22750","reward_exp":"560000","need_briefing":"1","title":"Red Inferno","briefing":"Soldier!<br><br>You aren't going to believe this sh*t! We've just spotted two huge flaming titans rampaging across the city. As I've sure you've guessed, these monstrosities are heading right for the Fort. Those damn things are running so fast I'm barely going to have time to mobilize my men.<br><br>I need you to intercept these beasts and at the very least buy us some time. Brownie points if you can kill it yourself. I've marked it's position on the map. Get over there ASAP!","special_enemy_type":"3 x Flaming Titan","special_enemy_amount":"3","boss_num":"1","event_type":"mission","dfp_objectives":{"kill":"Eliminate the Flaming Titans","kill_amount":"3","area_highlight":"1029_1006"},"start_time":"1786521601","end_time":"1786563601"},"2":{"event_id":"509683","game_id":"2","isoa":"0","locations":[["1001","984"]],"started":"1","ended":"0","reward_cash":"3100","reward_exp":"36000","need_briefing":"1","title":"That's My Map!","briefing":"I told them fools that leaving the Stockade was a bad idea. I reckon they\u2019re all either infected or in piles of zombie turds by now. They didn\u2019t even make it out of the city before we got a distress call on the radio. Sounds like the infected were yanking em\u2019 out of their vehicles and gnawing meat off their bones like chicken wings!<br><br>I don\u2019t figure any of em\u2019 are still alive at this point. Shame... there were some fine-ass ladies in that bunch too.<br><br>Anyhow, they took the best map we had of the outskirts of town, and didn\u2019t have the decency to even leave us a damn copy. I need you to go retrieve the map for me. I marked the last location of their convoy on your map.","special_enemy_type":"0","special_enemy_amount":"0","boss_num":"2","event_type":"mission","dfp_objectives":{"loot":"Find Dogg's map","loot_amount":"1","area_highlight":"1001_984"},"start_time":"1786521601","end_time":"1786563601"},"3":{"event_id":"509685","game_id":"3","isoa":"0","locations":[["1021","1019"]],"started":"1","ended":"0","reward_cash":"11500","reward_exp":"160000","need_briefing":"1","title":"Revenge","briefing":"Those bastards have taken everything from me! They've ruined my life, my career, killed my men, and now they've taken away what's left of my family! Well, I'm not gonna stand for this. I'm gonna kill every last one of these infected scum! They are going to pay for what they've done...<br><br>I know, I know, I'm not thinking clearly right now. But I don't care! I need revenge! Of course I can't ask my men to risk their lives just so I can take out my anger. I don't expect you to risk yours either, but if you did want to come along for the ride... well there's a big pile of cash in it for you.<br><br>If you do want in, meet me at the location I just marked on your map and we'll exterminate these bastards together!","special_enemy_type":"0","special_enemy_amount":"0","boss_num":"3","event_type":"mission","dfp_objectives":{"findnpc":"Meet up with Chief Jackson","findnpc_amount":"1","kill":"Kill the infected","kill_amount":"500","area_highlight":"1021_1019"},"start_time":"1786521601","end_time":"1786563601"},"4":{"event_id":"509687","game_id":"4","isoa":"0","locations":[["1047","987"]],"started":"1","ended":"0","reward_cash":"40500","reward_exp":"1400000","need_briefing":"1","title":"To The Slaughter","briefing":"We've just received word of a truely massive horde of infected heading towards this facility. Whilst we can always initiate our lock-down procedure, this would be the absolute last resort. The last time we used that option, we ended up under siege for several weeks before the horde finally lost interest and moved on. We'd rather not find ourselves trapped like that again.<br><br>I've marked the location of this horde on your map. Rendezvous with my men stationed there and exterminate the horde before they can reach the \r\nbunker.","special_enemy_type":"0","special_enemy_amount":"0","boss_num":"4","event_type":"mission","dfp_objectives":{"findnpc":"Rendezvous with the men","findnpc_amount":"1","kill":"Exterminate infected","kill_amount":"700","area_highlight":"1047_987"},"start_time":"1786521601","end_time":"1786563601"},"5":{"event_id":"509694","game_id":"5","isoa":"0","locations":[["1009","992"],["1004","1010"],["1007","999"],["1006","1006"],["1009","1004"],["1005","1001"],["1008","1000"],["1000","1008"],["1001","1004"]],"started":"1","ended":"0","reward_cash":"0","reward_exp":"0","need_briefing":"0","title":"","briefing":"","special_enemy_type":"1 x Bandits","special_enemy_amount":"1","boss_num":"1","event_type":"","dfp_objectives":[],"start_time":"1786525201","end_time":"1786528801"},"6":{"event_id":"509718","game_id":"6","isoa":"0","locations":[["1019","989"],["1023","1005"],["1021","1004"],["1023","989"],["10